        "body": "Everything the template points at is a canon address (tlz://twilite.zone/...) and nothing personal. A copy gets its own graph id and node ids.\n\n*Why:* Canon has to stand on its own, and copies must not be drawn as one node.\n\n*Checked by:* Test (mechanical).",
