        "body": "The template shows each state it can be in, with placeholder content and nobody's real work. Its landing page says what it is, what it derives and what it exports.\n\n*Why:* A starter is copied; real work in it is a mistake waiting to be copied.\n\n*Checked by:* Judgement; read at approval.",
